Confirmation accepts this exact snapshot, not later helper changes. Adjusting mappings captures a new snapshot. Master enable, EV lock, write permissions, manual modes, counters and history are not imported. Balancing may therefore differ from the old controller. The new entry stays read-only; the old controller is unchanged. Review sources next; replace legacy mapping sensors before removing their packages.

